<Layout title="Puff Collab — License and privacy">
  <h1>License and privacy</h1>
  <p>Puff Collab is an open-source fork of T3 Code. Original copyright notices and third-party licenses remain in the repository.</p>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/uzgorenm/puffcollab/blob/main/LICENSE">Read the license</a>.</p>
  <p>Local coding sessions use your own provider credentials. Linking to a hub identifies your account through GitHub. Shared collaboration content is sent to that hub; cooperation analysis also sends the selected content to your configured analysis provider when you enable it.</p>
  <p>Review the <a href="https://github.com/uzgorenm/puffcollab#readme">usage guide</a> before sharing a project, and use this repository's issues to report problems.</p>
</Layout>
